Brick is a fork of the upstream project as of mid-2026. The Go gateway lives
under apps/router/src/spatial-router. Local SystemOne inference uses the
PyTorch/Transformers worker under apps/router/systemone. Retired ML bindings,
calibrated routing, conversation hysteresis and local compaction were removed.
Additional maintained components include the CLI, protocol adapters, economics
and multimodal gateway. This notice preserves upstream attribution separately
from product identity, as required by Section 4 of the Apache License.
